{
  "protocolVersion": 2,
  "documents": [
    {
      "id": "doc-01",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "memory",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The spare key for the Cedar Pike allotment shed is inside the ceramic owl fixed to the west fence. I moved it there after the hook by the gate rusted through."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-02",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "memory",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "For the North Quay receipts project, paper invoices are stamped Marmalade-47 before scanning. The remaining May batch must be scanned by June 6."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-03",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "memory",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "My commuter bike's rear brake lever felt spongy on steep descents. The mechanic bled the hydraulic line and said trapped air had caused the soft lever."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-04",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "memory",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Dr Laleh Moradi at Oriole Clinic adjusted my night guard because it pressed against the left molar. The follow-up is booked for September 22."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-05",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "memory",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The June 3 morning ferry to Visby was cancelled because of high winds. I replaced it with the 14:20 flight that afternoon; the note does not include my seat number."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-06",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "memory",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Priya lent Mateo the thermal camera for his attic insulation survey. Mateo promised to return the infrared imager after he checks the north bedroom ceiling."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-07",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "memory",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "I installed the Kestrel P220 printer in the upstairs study and enabled automatic duplex printing. My setup note lists the starter toner model, but not its expected page yield."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-08",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "memory",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The bakery proofing drawer for sourdough is set to 68 percent humidity. That setting stopped a dry skin forming on the loaves before they went into the oven."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-09",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "memory",
      "language": "sv",
      "text": "Reservnyckeln till kolonilotten Lärkängen ligger i en röd plåtburk bakom regnvattentunnan. Jag flyttade den dit när lådan under bänken började läcka."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-10",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "memory",
      "language": "sv",
      "text": "Cykelns bakväxel hoppade mellan dreven när jag trampade hårt. Verkstaden spände vajern och indexerade växlarna, vilket tog bort problemet."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-11",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "memory",
      "language": "sv",
      "text": "Samira Ek är min handledare på keramikstudion i Forsvik. Hon bad mig ställa skålen med blå askglasyr på den nedersta hyllan i glasyrförrådet."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-12",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "memory",
      "language": "sv",
      "text": "Arbetsmötet Månstenen flyttades först från 4 februari till 11 februari. Den 9 februari kom beskedet att mötet var inställt helt."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-13",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "memory",
      "language": "sv",
      "text": "Oskar gav mätmikrofonen till Elin inför körinspelningen. Elin lånade i sin tur mikrofonstativet till Nils, men behöll själva mikrofonen."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-14",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "memory",
      "language": "sv",
      "text": "Luftavfuktaren i källarförrådet är inställd på 55 procents luftfuktighet och töms varje söndag. Anteckningen säger inget om apparatens effekt i watt."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-15",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "memory",
      "language": "sv",
      "text": "Projekt Tallkottens krypterade säkerhetskopia ligger på diskhylla B3. Jag verifierade senast kopian den 18 augusti efter månadsarkiveringen."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-16",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "conversation",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Mara: Leon, can you update the Atlas Finch changelog? Leon: I finished the draft and sent it to Quinn for approval. Quinn: I will review it after lunch."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-17",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "conversation",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Customer: The Lantern hub keeps pulsing amber. Support: That pattern means it is waiting for a network address. Restarting the router should let DHCP assign one."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-18",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "conversation",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Ava: Did the architect choose a skylight supplier for Rillstone? Ben: Yes, Keon Wallace approved Solmere Glass at yesterday's design review."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-19",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "conversation",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Nora: Wednesday's 08:30 demo no longer works. Ivo: I moved it to Friday at 15:00. Nora: Please make that 13:00 Friday instead. Ivo: Updated."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-20",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "conversation",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Rae: The projector in Room Heron is locked again. Sol: Use the local passphrase violet-magnet; the guest Wi-Fi password is different."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-21",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "conversation",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Dina: Green Apron confirmed twelve vegetarian meals for the workshop. Mo: Did they price the nut-free dessert? Dina: No, they said that quote will be available on Monday."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-22",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "conversation",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Zoe: Arun, please own the database migration checklist. Arun: I can do that, and I have asked Mei to run the rollback rehearsal before launch."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-23",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "conversation",
      "language": "sv",
      "text": "Maja: Anders, din returetikett har supportkoden FJORD-82. Anders: Var lämnar jag paketet? Maja: I paketskåp 14 vid stationen."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-24",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "conversation",
      "language": "sv",
      "text": "Lova: Bildflödet blir hackigt efter några minuter. Per: Stäng av maskinvaruaccelerationen i spelaren. Lova: Det hjälpte, nu rullar videon jämnt."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-25",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "conversation",
      "language": "sv",
      "text": "Hugo: Vem ansvarar för belysningsplanen i Kvarnvik nu? Sara: Linnea Sjöberg tog över den när Olle gick på ledighet den 12 januari."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-26",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "conversation",
      "language": "sv",
      "text": "Noor: Leveransen var först lovad till tisdag 07.30. Tage: Sedan ändrades tiden till torsdag 12.00, men bilen kom redan 10.45 på torsdagen. Förarens namn nämndes inte."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-27",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "conversation",
      "language": "sv",
      "text": "Fatima: Jag skickade budgeten till Joel 09.10. Joel: Tack, jag vidarebefordrade bilagan till Rut 09.24 men behöll kalkylbladet hos mig."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-28",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "conversation",
      "language": "sv",
      "text": "Ester: Samlingslokalen är bokad och har plats för 36 personer. Bo: Finns pentry och projektor? Ester: Pentry finns. Jag vet inte hur lång projektorns kabel är."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-29",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "conversation",
      "language": "sv",
      "text": "Alva: Var hamnade originalkontrakten? Kim: I arkivlådan NÄVER-19 på hylla D4. Kopiorna ligger fortfarande hos ekonomi."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-30",
      "tenant": "fixture-owner",
      "corpus": "conversation",
      "language": "sv",
      "text": "Mio: Det droppar från takfönstrets innerkant när det blåser från väster. Sanna: Jag bytte tätningslisten runt karmen. Mio: Bra, sedan dess har det hållit tätt."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-31",
      "tenant": "other-owner",
      "corpus": "memory",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Rowan keeps the cobalt kayak permit in a yellow dry bag under the boathouse steps. The renewal receipt is clipped inside the same bag."
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-32",
      "tenant": "other-owner",
      "corpus": "conversation",
      "language": "sv",
      "text": "Karin: Återbetalningen för FJORD-82 ska gå till konto 4317-22. Teo: Jag registrerar det i eftermiddag."
    }
  ],
